  "reflectionText": "Ezekiel was among the captives by the river Chebar when the heavens opened: a stormy wind, four living creatures, wheels within wheels, a throne of sapphire. He fell on his face and heard a voice. How do you receive a vision of the throne of God when you are sitting by the river of your exile?"
